{
    "name": "§eLalo Salamanca",
    "entityType": "easy_npc:humanoid",
    "description": "The charming and terrifying nephew of Hector Salamanca, sent to investigate Gus Fring's operations. Unlike his brutish cousins, Lalo is intelligent, personable, and utterly remorseless.",
